aattprole ~ scidpbordRe # Parent RC (M2) predicted by Parent BPD (X2)
CTSmom_MomAllABofAdo ~ scidpbordRe  # abuse torwards adolescent (Y) predicted by Parent BPD (X2)
CTSmom_MomAllABofAdo ~ aattprole # abuse torwards adolescent (Y) predicted by Parent RC (M2)
aattacare ~ scidpbordRe # Adolescent RC (M1) predicted by Parent BPD (X2)
